<title>USA: TABLE - Virginia Gas Q2 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Virginia Gas Q2 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ABINGDON, Va. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.04     loss	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net profit		   128     loss	    21</p>
<p> Revs			 1,931			467</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,214		    1,171</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
